{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"佛教大学学園祭と関西大学学園祭たのしかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/2484468/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ファミリーのかたがいっぱいいたー(*^^*)\nまたきてねー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部屋はみくもと同じだったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/2484468/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/2484468/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいしゃべった♪♪\nみくも面白すぎるｗｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"移動中のバスも帰りの新幹線も一緒♪♪\n楽しかったー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/2484468/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/2484468/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか八ツ橋買えたよー(。・・。)ノ\nチョコのと普通のやつ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/2484468/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日はある撮影をしたあとBLTの生写真の撮影してあとレッスンしてきたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/2484468/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生写真の衣装めっちゃ可愛かった(o^^o)\n楽しみにしててね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、昨日はMJの収録(。・・。)ノ\n新曲を披露しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/2484468/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新曲のタイトルは...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆「制服のマネキン」☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスも歌もかっこいい感じ(´ー`)\n衣装はセーラー服"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/2484468/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみ髪型はお団子にしたよー♪\n4thはお団子にしよっかな(´ー`)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メはまた今度のせるね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/2484468/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返しー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/2484468/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"得意な教科と苦手な教科教えて！\n得意っていうか好きなのは、体育、音楽、家庭科、理科かな♪苦手なのは国語、数字、社会、英語(´ー`)ｗｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/2484468/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服でかっこいい系の服着ないの？\n最近は黒系すきだからよく着るよー(*^o^*)今度写メ載せるね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/2484468/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみの部屋ってどんな感じ？\nごちゃごちゃしてる(´・ω・｀)ｗきれいになったら写メ載せるかも?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/2484468/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみの自転車は何色？\nピンク♪中学はいったときくらいから乗ってるよー(´ー`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/2484468/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"料理はできるの？\nなめんなー?ｗｗ作り方みればだいたい作れるよー♪料理の企画あったらいいなー♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2012/11/07/%E3%81%BF%E3%81%AA%E3%81%BF%EF%BC%93.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"}